{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1413779-can-the-blood-oath-still-be-given-in-the-modern-nights","id":1413779,"title":"Can the blood oath still be given in the modern nights?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-15T08:13:13-07:00","id":1413779,"title":"Can the blood oath still be given in the modern nights?","content":"So in the dark ages, the bloodbond exist instead as the blood oath. The main difference being that instead of love, it creates a sense of loyalty and obligation.<br /> <br /> So can vampires in the modern nights still give a blood oath instead of a blood bond? <br /> Or is this not possible due to changes in the blood or mindset of kine?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26067-wingstorm","name":"Wingstorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-15T11:20:30-07:00","id":1413805,"title":"","content":"I always considered the two to be synonyms, not separate things. And whether the blood bond creates love (as in romantic love or passion) or a sense of deep set devotion and loyalty is really just flavor text describing how the bond works out between the regnant and thrall. It depends on the personalities and relationship of the regnant and thrall, not some historical change in mentality.<br /> <br /> It could just be my ignorance if there was an actual supplement stating these were not the same.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-15T11:39:36-07:00","id":1413809,"title":"","content":"Don't the Tremere have a ritual with a contract that for a nominal fee* they can bind two parties together. <br /> <br /> *blood,boons or bullion","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-15T11:59:37-07:00","id":1413812,"title":"","content":"I always took it as just another term for blood bond, Vinculum being the more...emotionally neutral term? If that makes any sense. I might be displaying my ignorance though, as was said above.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target